          "text": "Uma inyama yeminikelo yakhe yokuthula idliwa nokuncane ngosuku lwesithathu, ayiyikwamukeleka, futhi ayiyikubalelwa onikelayo; kuyakuba yisinengiso, nomphefumulo odlayo. Kuwo uyakuthwala ububi.",
