        },
        {
          "text": "Umphefumulo othinta noma yini engcolile, ukungcola komuntu, noma yisiphi isilwane esingcolile noma into enengekayo eyisinengiso, bese edla inyama yomnikelo wokubonga engekaJehova, lowo mphefumulo uyakunqunywa esandleni sakhe abantu.",
